  "measurementBasis": "Original Sonic PAL case photograph; auction specimen description; manufacturer protector fit envelope. The 129 \u00d7 177 \u00d7 26 mm body and 188 mm height including hanger are nominal estimates from protector fit and specimen photographs. Mold revision, clip offsets, sleeve thickness and booklet pagination are approximate. Flexible spine folds use rigid pivots.",
  "changes": [
    "Removed broad fold glare and dust from the Sonic spine by restoring its measured dark grid while retaining the original title and Mega Drive logo pixels.",
    "Reduced color speckle across the wrap and booklet covers with gentle luminance/chroma descreening; retained the original screenshots and multilingual rear text.",
    "Used the independently released mega-drive box template v0.1.0; retained its decoded geometry, artwork UVs and Open animation.",
    "Included the revised prepared PNGs, transformation provenance and hash-bound Blender/Godot validation."
  ],
